        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "SIGPIPE (13): wrote to a pipe with no reader",
            "Default action kills you outright",
            "Servers SIG_IGN it and check write for EPIPE",
            "SIGALRM (14): alarm() or setitimer() expired"
          ]
